to have its life cycle.

00:16:34.110 --> 00:16:39.110
So if it, if it can't infect
cells through interacting

00:16:39.620 --> 00:16:41.530
with the ACE2 receptor,

00:16:41.530 --> 00:16:46.530
then it has to find a
different way to keep living.

00:16:50.420 --> 00:16:54.510
- So, I had one question
